flowchart TD
  A[Chunk-start state Ac and epoch] --> P13[Block 13 reads Ac]
  A --> P27[Block 27 reads Ac]
  O[Completed eligible observation chunk] --> W13[Port 13 write proposal]
  O --> W27[Port 27 write proposal]
